description:
@RuralJapan 
聖地・熊野、三重県御浜町きて、初めて見る雪は世話が焼ける。
でも、真っ白な町はいつもより、ワクワクする

@RuralJapan
The sacred place, Kumano, in Mihama Town, Mie Prefecture, has its first snow, which is a bit of a hassle.
However, the completely white town is more exciting than usual.

We had the amazing opportunity to stay in a traditional Japanese inn (ryokan 旅館) and experience an outdoor onsen (露天風呂) in winter time with snow all around us! If you are ever visiting Japan in winter we would highly recommend this experience! We stayed in Ganiba Onsen in Akita and during our time at the ryokan we also got to experience a traditional multi-course Japanese dinner and breakfast. 

//COME SAY HI!
Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/royandaimee/

//MUSIC FROM: 
Epidemic Sound - https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/zjyf0a/

西予市の田之筋わらパークに行ってきました。
藁マンモス以外の造形物があることは知っていたのですがどこにあるかわからなかったので行けていませんでした。

感想は控えております(^^;

I visited Tanomusubi Straw Park in Seiyo City.
I knew there were other sculptures besides the straw mammoth, but I didn't know where they were, so I hadn't been able to go.

I will refrain from sharing my impressions (^^;
